SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Dormition\, Potamos
LOCATION:Potamos\, Kythira\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Potamos\, the market town of the north\, throws its annual chorós on the night of 15 August in the big square\, organised by the Potamos cultural association: live orchestra\, tables\, grilled meat and wine\, and the whole north of the island plus the returned Australians dancing until late. The square is small for the crowd\; eat first at one of the tavernas around it and drift in around 11pm.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kythira/#potamos-panigiri-of-the-dormition-potamos
